        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Ancestral/scene_bulldog.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 0fee1154-c66b-41e1-b504-897374cfdaff).Image",
        "Description": "Alexa Carlisle built her empire on the bodies of her enemies, make it crumble from within.  our client wants the Carlisle legacy completely erased, will you let Alexa survive to witness the total extinction of her bloodline, or show 47&apos;s merciful side give her the real end. \rYour mission is to infiltrate Thornbridge Manor and execute every single member of the family. You must move like a ghost through the estate, turn the historic mansion into a silent tomb. your client wants this quiet, do it.",
